      "domain": "addition",
      "steps": [
        0
      ],
      "why": "Five problems: 0+1, 1+0, 1+1 and their wordings. The set of true facts with both operands at most one is genuinely almost this small."
    },
    {
      "domain": "subtraction",
      "steps": [
        2
      ],
      "why": "Five problems. Narrow but serviceable."
    },
    {
      "domain": "subtraction",
      "steps": [
        15
      ],
      "why": "Three facts exist and three is the ceiling: 20-0, 20-10 and 20-20 are the only subtractions inside twenty that derive onto step 15. One is authored. Structurally thin rather than under-authored."
    }
  ],
